fix_details:
  F1: findFfmpeg accepts only a regular executable file. FFMPEG_BIN is an absolute path or a
    basename searched on PATH. An empty value is unset. Empty PATH entries are skipped, so the
    working directory is never searched. A directory on PATH is skipped. A failed lookup exits with
    AC2's missing-binary line before target preparation and before earshot starts.
  F2: the wrapper checks both the .ogg and the .mp3 target with lstatSync before removing either.
    A blocked target exits with the exact preparation line and leaves the other file in place.
    Stale-target removal failures keep the exact preparation line without a stack trace.
  F3: plan.md and the earlier block of this log now describe the Ogg byte changes per file. Every
    changed byte is an Ogg stream serial or page CRC. Three-page files change 24 bytes. right.ogg
    and level-end.ogg have four pages and change 32 bytes each.
scope:
  The AC2 failure lines and the pinned ffmpeg argv are unchanged. No test was edited. No render ran
  into sounds/. The committed .ogg and .mp3 files are unchanged.
